WEBVTT

00:05:28.212 --> 00:05:30.343
memorizing phone books,

00:05:30.367 --> 00:05:32.946
which was scintillating.

00:05:32.970 --> 00:05:35.703
(Laughter)

00:05:35.727 --> 00:05:39.885
And I went back and I read
a whole host of memory treatises,

00:05:39.909 --> 00:05:44.297
treatises written 2,000-plus
years ago in Latin,

00:05:44.321 --> 00:05:46.995
in antiquity, and then later,
in the Middle Ages.

00:05:47.456 --> 00:05:50.170
And I learned a whole bunch
of really interesting stuff.

00:05:50.670 --> 00:05:53.216
One of the really interesting
things that I learned

00:05:53.240 --> 00:05:55.490
is that once upon a time,

00:05:55.514 --> 00:06:01.782
this idea of having a trained,
disciplined, cultivated memory